# Local tooling
# .claude holds per-machine run configuration. M3 D17: launch.json is now
# portable — `npm run dev`, no absolute paths — so it is tracked, and a fresh
# clone can start the dev server. Everything else under .claude/ stays ignored.
#
# The backend and GenAI service are NOT launched from here. They live in the other
# repository and are launched from its own .claude/launch.json; the entries that
# used to be here reached across repos with absolute paths, which is the thing
# that made this file unshareable in the first place.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json
